Signing writes the secondary protection tag and verification checks it.

sec = HMAC-SHA-256(key, digest1)[:1], where digest1 is the full 32-byte primary
digest. Previously the signer left the field zero and the verifier ignored it.
Streams signed without this patch now fail verification on that field.
Apply after 01-infomdat-hole.patch. Includes tests and docs updates.

